  "description": "The META POWER SX V4 BOSCH RIDE is ideal for getting started with e-bike enduro riding.\n• The 170mm ROCKSHOX Domain RC fork stands out for its rigidity and its air spring that adjusts to any rider weight. Thanks to a setting adapted to the frame's kinematics, the ROCKSHOX Deluxe Select shock provides comfortable rear suspension.\n• SRAM Guide RE 4-piston brakes and 220mm rotors provide the stopping power in any situation as they are developed for e-MTB use.\n• The wheels feature SPANK Spike Race 33 rims mounted on Formula hubs specially reinforced for e-MTB use.\n• The SRAM SX Eagle 12-speed drivetrain offers 11-50 gearing. Perfect for steep climbs and varied terrain.",
